==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Molduga Guts can be obtained by defeating [[Molduga]], which can be found under the sand in the [[Gerudo Desert]]. They can be used in a [[Cooking Pot]] along with critters to make [[Elixir]]s. In addition, they can be sold to [[Kilton]] at the [[Fang and Bone]] in exchange for [[Mon]] or used as an ingredient for Green [[Dye]] at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

When spoken to, [[Malena]] explains to [[Link]] that her husband is sick and the only cure is Molduga Guts.<ref name="BotW Malena"/> After, Link receives the [[Side Quest]] "[[Medicinal Molduga]]". Upon delivery of Molduga Guts, Malena will reward Link with a [[Gold Rupee]].

The [[Radiant Set]] requires Molduga Guts to be upgraded to its third tier at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]]. They're also needed to upgrade the [[Sand Boots]] to their third and fourth tiers.
